{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Eventual Calendar 是一款行事曆工具，把行程、提醒事項與每日規劃整合在同一個介面，適合工作會議、家庭活動與個人目標交錯的用家。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費，可於 App Store 下載。</p>\n\n<h2>行程範本與提醒整合</h2>\n<p>Eventual 提供月、週與時間軸三種檢視，讓你一眼看清整體行程或專注單日安排。內建 Stencils 範本，可為輪班、兼職等非固定週期行程預先建立範本，日後一鍵套用。你亦可直接在 App 內完成 Apple Reminders，任務與行程統一顯示，配合搜尋與篩選快速找回活動。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-456-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-457-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-458-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-459-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-460-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-461-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Eventual Calendar</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-02T06:18:29.766383+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":313,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}